{"Title":"An Act dedicating the boat ramp at Bicentennial Park in the city of Fall River as the State Representative Manuel Raposa Jr. Boat Ramp","BillNumber":"H4163","DocketNumber":"HD4601","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CAF1","Name":"Carole A. Fiola","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-03T14:54:12.13"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CAF1","Name":"Carole A. Fiola","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-03T14:54:12.13"},{"Id":"MJR0","Name":"Michael J. Rodrigues","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJR0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-04T09:19:18.1833333"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"MJR0","Name":"Michael J. Rodrigues","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJR0","ResponseDate":"2023-10-04T09:19:18.103"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4163/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Fiola of Fall River and Senator Rodrigues, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Carole A. Fiola and Michael J. Rodrigues that the boat ramp at Bicentennial Park in the city of Fall River be designated as the State Representative Manuel Raposa Jr. Boat Ramp.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION__. The boat ramp at Bicentennial Park in the city of Fall River shall be designated and known as the State Representative Manuel Raposa Jr. Boat Ramp. The Department of Conversation and Recreation shall erect suitable markers bearing that designation in compliance with the standards of that agency. The department shall be responsible for the maintenance of the markers.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33"